title IT Help Desk

component helpdesk-webapp as "Help Desk Web App" web-application
component helpdesk-api as "Help Desk API" service
component helpdesk-db as "Help Desk Database" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server

north -> helpdesk-webapp
north -> helpdesk-api

helpdesk-webapp -> helpdesk-api
helpdesk-webapp -> user-auth
helpdesk-api -> user-auth
helpdesk-api -> helpdesk-db
